{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/193879-naming-a-lunar-knack","id":193879,"title":"Naming a Lunar Knack","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-10T12:56:47-07:00","id":193879,"title":"Naming a Lunar Knack","content":"I need help coming up with a name for a Lunar Knack. The idea of this knack is similar to how Deadly Beastman Transformation gives you a true form based on your totem, this knack will bestow you a unique true form based upon the prerequisite knacks that allow you to assume the forms/race of other entities ie Fair Folk, Ghosts, Demons, Gods, etc. I'm tentatively naming it Inner Prey Metamorphosis but it doesn't really jive with me. So I leave it to you all to help me with more creative suggestions. Please, Forumites, you're my only hope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/15.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2104-tenkage","name":"Tenkage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T14:08:50-07:00","id":193966,"title":"","content":"So this would give you a True Fair Folk/Ghost/Demon/etc form? <br /> <br /> What about something like<br /> <br /> Swallowing the Hunted Name<br /> Prerequisite: One of: Green Sun Child, Hearth-and-Flame Shell, Laurels-And-Ivy Technique, or Luna's Hidden Face.<br /> Minimum Attribute and Essence: One higher for both Attribute and Essence than the prerequisite Knack.<br /> When you perform the ritual hunt on a target in line with the prerequisite Knack, you also add this shape to your list of True Forms. You may only purchase this Knack once for each of its prerequisites (ie, one Demonic True Form, one Elemental true form, and one Plant true form). If you have an enhancement to one of the prerequisite Charms (such as Heart-Theft of the Behemoth), the forms allowed by the enhancement are also valid targets for this Knack, but those enhancement Knacks do not allow an extra purchase of Swallowing the Hunted Name. Additional form acquisition knacks may permit extra purchases of this Knack with Storyteller approval (such as a custom Knack allowing the hunting of a ghost). This Knack greatly increases the risk of Chimerism, and therefore adds one box of permanent limit each time it is taken.<br /> <br /> Personally, I would prefer a complete rewrite of the Lunar shapeshifting rules, so that you don't get locked into your True Forms. You know what's not awesome about being an awesome shapeshifter? Not being able to shapeshift. Or being forced to carry a flag that says 'Look at me, I'm a Lunar shapeshifter!'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2132-ejtaka","name":"Ejtaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2132_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1064"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T14:24:09-07:00","id":193979,"title":"","content":"I'd suggest that Lunars call it something differentbased on what they're drawing upon: Ghosts lead to Unskinned Spectre-Beast Shape, while a Steward with Green Sun Child has laid the foundation for Terrifying Hell-Child's Skin, etc. Were I writing this up, I'd stat up one and wrap it up with &quot;The Children of Luna have many Knacks similar to this one; a Lunar with Laurels-and-Ivy Technique and (apprpopriate prerequisite stats) may likewise base a new true form using similar mechanics using Walking Forest Mantle&quot;, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T14:59:49-07:00","id":193998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/193879-naming-a-lunar-knack?p=193979#post193979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd suggest that Lunars call it something differentbased on what they're drawing upon: Ghosts lead to Unskinned Spectre-Beast Shape, while a Steward with Green Sun Child has laid the foundation for Terrifying Hell-Child's Skin, etc. Were I writing this up, I'd stat up one and wrap it up with &quot;The Children of Luna have many Knacks similar to this one; a Lunar with Laurels-and-Ivy Technique and (apprpopriate prerequisite stats) may likewise base a new true form using similar mechanics using Walking Forest Mantle&quot;, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mockery's idea is about how I'd roll, given how Lunars work: one Knack as a stand-in for the multiple versions, with their own prerequisites.<br /> <br /> Still, the names are the main thing Tenkage was after, so some ideas:<br /> <br /> <u>Raksha</u>: Spun of Heartless Grace<br /> <u>Demon</u>: Seed Sown Beyond Silver Sands<br /> <u>God</u>: Ambrosia-Supped Deity<br /> <u>Elemental</u>: Primal Foundation Shape<br /> <u>Ghost</u>: Phantom in Flesh<br /> <u>Plant</u>: Enlivened Leaves Unfurled<br /> <br /> I am not at all happy with Ambrosia-Supped Deity. :/ Reference to ambrosia is nice, but ulgh. Primal Foundation Shape and Enlivened Leave Unfurled also underwhelm me, but I'm relatively okay with the rest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://avatarcomic.net/exalted-wiki/Exalted_3E:What_We_Know\" target=\"_blank\">The EX3 What We Know Wiki</a>, courtesy of Marin and JMobius<br /> <a href=\"http://nishkriya.com\" target=\"_blank\">Nishkriya, the EX3 Freelancer Quotes Tracker</a>, courtesy of Anathema and Moonwolf<br /> <a href=\"http://forums.whitewolfarchive.com/\" target=\"_blank\">The White Wolf Forum Archive</a>, courtesy of The Dark Wizard and Sanctaphrax (see <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/PhilippeSaner?u=159709\" target=\"_blank\">its Patreon</a>) <hr />Arrghus: There's also the Shepherd of the North Star, busily guiding the one thing in all the heavens that <i>doesn't move</i>.","edited":{"userid":558,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","user":"Gaius","date":". 07-10-2014, 06:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/558-gaius","name":"Gaius","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T15:10:31-07:00","id":194003,"title":"","content":"See, I knew you guys could help. Thanks for the great suggestions.<br /> <br /> The idea is that it creates a unique true from of that type rather than making a disguise form your true form, much the way your totem is a unique expression of you and the gender bending knack is a female version of you. So Ghost version you is you as a ghost and Fae you is a manifestation of your story as a Fair Folk Noble or what have you. Demon you is you as a demon that you most associate with, so even though you may have hunted thousands of different demons you may be a Neomah as your true demon form or if you have a high enough essence maybe appearing as a Third Circle Demon descended from a relevant Yozi. Mind you, you're not actually subject to Yozi possession and no one remembers you as such. You're a stranger that is quite clearly a demon of whatever power but your cover is your own to provide. Obviously some issue with the Yozi in question possibly blowing your cover but that's a plot twist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/15.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2104-tenkage","name":"Tenkage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}